WHY THE SPLIT

The valuable part of this repository is the reasoning, and reasoning does not
stay put. People who had never read these documents re-invented the central
idea — that a worker's claim is not evidence until something else re-runs the
check — entirely unprompted, and that is the point rather than a leak. So the method is free, and the
condition is credit.

The tools are a different question. They are the part someone could ship inside
a product, and that is the conversation worth having in advance.

